    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Captain of the powerful convict mercenary band called the Red Eye. He was drafted with other convicts during Gracia's invasion, but was abandoned by the main army during a retreat. Following the war, he and his men did not return to their country, preferring to stay in the Dion Territory occupied during the war, sacking and ambushing. He believes the Gracian Army and its commanders were cowards for leaving his men behind. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
